@baseUrl = https://localhost:7092
@apiKey = merchant-one-api-key-dev

### ============================================================
### POST /api/v1/payments — Process a Payment
### ============================================================

### 1. Authorized payment (card ending in 7 → odd → authorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2027,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### 2. Declined payment (card ending in 2 → even → declined)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248112",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2027,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 500,
  "cvv": "456"
}

### 3. Rejected payment — business rule violation (blocked BIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "cardNumber": "1234565343248112",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2027,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 500,
  "cvv": "456"
}

### ============================================================
### GET /api/v1/payments/{id} — Retrieve a Payment
### ============================================================

### 11. Get an existing payment by ID
# Replace <payment-id> with the `id` returned from a POST request above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Payments/<payment-id>
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 12. Not Found — payment ID does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 13. Unauthorized — missing API key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
